"Insert a Conventional Commits type, Co-authored-by or Signed-off-by" = "Conventional Commits の型、Co-authored-by、Signed-off-by を入れる";
"Not loaded yet" = "まだ読めていません";
"Signed-off-by (Me)" = "Signed-off-by（自分）";

